  "hero_summary_zh": "众人永远能感受到复仇之魂的存在，不管她是生是死。她可以与周围任何英雄交换位置，击晕敌人，不幸阵亡还能让凶手的输出大打折扣。有她在场，给敌人带去的混乱将源源不断。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Vengeful Spirit's presence is felt at all times, whether she is alive or dead. Able to swap positions with any nearby hero, stun enemies, and reduce her killer's effectiveness if she falls, she constantly brings confusion and chaos to her foes.",
